Simple X Hotkey Daemon Key Bindings for BSPWM
---------------------------------------------

General

|-------+-----+------+-------+-----+----------------------------|
| Super | Alt | Ctrl | Shift | Key | Description                |
|-------+-----+------+-------+-----+----------------------------|
| Super |     | Ctrl |       | h   | Display BSPWM Key Bindings |
| Super |     |      | Shift | w   | Close Node                 |
| Super |     |      | Shift | k   | Kill Node                  |
|-------+-----+------+-------+-----+----------------------------|


State

|-------+-----+------+-------+-----+-----------------------------------------|
| Super | Alt | Ctrl | Shift | Key | Description                             |
|-------+-----+------+-------+-----+-----------------------------------------|
| Super |     | Ctrl |       | t   | Tiled Layout                            |
| Super |     | Ctrl | Shift | t   | Pseudo-Tiled Layout                     |
| Super |     | Ctrl |       | f   | Fullscreen Layout                       |
| Super |     | Ctrl | Shift | f   | Floating Layout                         |
| Super |     | Ctrl |       | m   | Toggle Layout (Tiled, Stacked, Monocle) |
|-------+-----+------+-------+-----+-----------------------------------------|

Focus and Swap

|-------+-----+------+-------+---------+----------------------------|
| Super | Alt | Ctrl | Shift | Key     | Description                |
|-------+-----+------+-------+---------+----------------------------|
| Super |     |      |       | j,Left  | Focus Node: Previous       |
| Super |     |      |       | l,Right | Focus Node: Next           |
| Super |     |      | Shift | j,Left  | Swap Node: Previous        |
| Super |     |      | Shift | l,Right | Swap Node: Next            |
| Super |     |      |       | period  | Circulate Node: Forward    |
| Super |     |      | Shift | period  | Swap Node: Forward         |
| Super |     |      |       | comma   | Circulate Node: Backward   |
| Super |     |      | Shift | comma   | Swap Node: Backward        |
| Super |     |      |       | i,Up    | Focus Desktop: Previous    |
| Super |     |      |       | k,Down  | Focus Desktop: Next        |
| Super |     |      | Shift | i,Up    | Swap Node: Previous        |
| Super |     |      | Shift | k,Down  | Swap Node: Next            |
| Super |     |      |       | PgUp    | Focus Monitor: Previous    |
| Super |     |      |       | PgDn    | Focus Monitor: Next        |
| Super |     |      |       | Tab     | Focus Desktop: Next        |
| Super |     |      | Shift | Tab     | Focus Desktop: Previous    |
|       | Alt |      |       | Tab     | Focus Node: Next           |
|       | Alt |      | Shift | Tab     | Focus Node: Previous       |
|       | Alt |      |       | grave   | Focus Node: Last           |
| Super |     |      |       | grave   | Focus Desktop: Last        |
| Super |     |      |       | 1-9,0   | Focus Desktop: #           |
| Super |     |      | Shift | 1-9,0   | Move Node to Desktop: #    |
|-------+-----+------+-------+---------+----------------------------|

Move and Resize

|-------+-----+------+-------+-----+---------------------------|
| Super | Alt | Ctrl | Shift | Key | Description               |
|-------+-----+------+-------+-----+---------------------------|
| Super |     | Ctrl |       | s   | Resize/Move Node Mode [1] |
| Super |     | Ctrl |       | b   | Balance Nodes             |
| Super |     | Ctrl |       | e   | Equalize Nodes            |
|-------+-----+------+-------+-----+---------------------------|

[1] After entering resize/move window mode, use i/I, k/K, j/J, and l/L to
expand/contract the current window, and use Up, Down, Left, and Right arrow
keys to move a floating window around. Press Esc to exit mode.
